  "instructions": [
    "Boil the potatoes until tender, then mash them with part of the butter and the milk.",
    "Brown the onion in the remaining butter, then add the beef and cook it through.",
    "Press the seasoned beef into a square baking dish and spread the creamed corn over it.",
    "Cover the corn with mashed potatoes and sprinkle the top with paprika and parsley.",
    "Bake at 375°F until hot and lightly browned, then rest the casserole before serving."
